      "description": "Watch Jagiellonia vs Rangers highlights and goals from UEFA Europa League on ReFooty: Football Highlights Hub. Match played on August 6, 2026. The stage was set for a high-intensity European clash, with both sides eager to make their mark on the continental stage. Held on August 6, 2026 , the UEFA Europa League encounter between Jagiellonia and Rangers promised drama from the very first whistle. An electric opening The match began at a breakneck pace. Just four minutes in, misfortune struck Jagiellonia as Guilherme Montoia inadvertently turned the ball into his own net, gifting Rangers an early lead. However, the home side responded with clinical efficiency. Kajetan Szmyt took control of the narrative, scoring in the 13th and 21st minutes to flip the scoreline and put the visitors under immense pressure. Tactical shifts and late drama With the lead secured, Jagiellonia focused on managing the tempo of the game. The second half saw a flurry of substitutions as both managers looked to inject fresh energy into their lineups. Despite Rangers pushing for an equalizer, the defensive structure of the home side held firm. The dying moments saw tempers flare, with yellow cards issued to Yuki Kobayashi and Nicolas Raskin as the final whistle approached."
